    "MSP-10.1": "CMS Pub. 100-05 Ch. 5 s10.1: CWF MSP auxiliary file records periods when another insurer pays first. Demo rule: claim in an MSP period with $0 primary payment is rejected MSP_PRIMARY_NOT_BILLED (docs/rules.md).",
